01:09:51.810 --> 01:09:56.770
been used in years. I've no idea if it will fly safely, but I'm sure that's a risk you're

01:09:56.770 --> 01:09:57.510
prepared to take.

01:10:00.350 --> 01:10:02.270
I'm very grateful.

01:10:02.270 --> 01:10:04.580
I only wish I could go with you.

01:10:04.580 --> 01:10:13.380
You look so beautiful.

01:10:47.020 --> 01:10:54.040
Thank you, Meyer. I want all of you. Why not?

01:10:54.770 --> 01:11:00.000
I don't know what it's like, Charlotte, to live forever in darkness.

01:11:00.090 --> 01:11:08.840
eternal forever thirsting for blood despite your best intention i can't imagine that life for you

01:11:08.840 --> 01:11:19.410
not for you charlotte you're so selfish meyer i carry a heavy weight on my conscience those

01:11:19.410 --> 01:11:25.940
villagers and the bounty hunter and my family they still mourn my loss meyer it wasn't your

01:11:25.940 --> 01:11:29.360
doing charlotte it was my fault entirely

01:11:31.210 --> 01:11:36.850
then we're both to blame because we can't know happiness not anymore i wanted you to be happy

01:11:36.850 --> 01:11:42.580
mire and so i abandoned my father and my brother for you but their pain set the wheels in motion

01:11:42.580 --> 01:11:52.480
for our pain and so on and on it goes all we have is each other now and i want to be close to you

01:11:52.480 --> 01:12:00.000
without that we have nothing all the pain i've

01:12:00.060 --> 01:12:05.620
caused and all the agony I feel is nothing now. And you are everything to me, my love.

01:12:11.870 --> 01:12:19.410
We'll talk more on our trip to the stars if that's all right with you.

01:12:23.870 --> 01:12:30.000
There is some unfinished business I have to attend to. Do not leave this room, understand?

01:13:09.880 --> 01:13:25.510
The woman says she wants to go back home.

01:13:34.960 --> 01:13:37.010
I don't believe it.

01:14:00.280 --> 01:14:18.760
Something's not worse, sir.

01:14:18.760 --> 01:14:21.040
You don't have to take my word for it.

01:14:21.040 --> 01:14:24.820
Judge for yourself.

01:14:56.880 --> 01:14:57.460
Let's go.

01:15:00.670 --> 01:15:02.070
Layla, don't go.

01:15:03.520 --> 01:15:05.320
Layla, don't go in there.

01:15:05.720 --> 01:15:08.240
If you go in there, you're never coming back.

01:15:08.740 --> 01:15:10.260
Oh, I'm coming back.

01:15:11.900 --> 01:15:13.050
No!

01:15:31.400 --> 01:15:33.600
I'm on it.

01:15:40.450 --> 01:15:41.470
Nice hat.

01:16:29.210 --> 01:16:30.000
I know you hate me.

01:16:31.210 --> 01:16:34.010
- Please, try and understand.

01:16:34.010 --> 01:16:36.410
I loved your father.

01:16:36.410 --> 01:16:41.620
What choice did I have?

01:17:01.080 --> 01:17:03.720
No, Kyle!

01:17:03.720 --> 01:17:07.110
Hey, I don't believe it.

01:17:07.110 --> 01:17:10.290
You two sure are sight for sore eyes.

01:17:10.290 --> 01:17:12.960
Gah, fuck!

01:17:37.680 --> 01:17:38.680
What are you doing?

01:17:38.680 --> 01:17:39.680
Get up!

01:17:39.680 --> 01:17:42.420
Why aren't you listening?

01:17:42.420 --> 01:17:43.410
I said get up!

01:17:43.410 --> 01:17:49.560
Leave me alone!

01:18:04.190 --> 01:18:07.540
- Can you forgive me, Dee?

01:18:07.540 --> 01:18:12.620
Dee, I know it's been lonely for you.

01:18:12.620 --> 01:18:17.380
I was lonely too, until you came along.

01:18:17.380 --> 01:18:20.870
Did you hear, Dee?

01:18:30.120 --> 01:18:39.560
It's okay honey, it's okay to cry. I know, I know how you feel. It wasn't your fault. It wasn't.

01:18:40.750 --> 01:18:41.870
Yes it was!

01:18:42.070 --> 01:18:59.020
Just an illusion. Carmilla's playing with us.

01:19:02.330 --> 01:19:03.830
Excellent. What fun.

01:19:05.290 --> 01:19:07.430
I haven't had this much fun in centuries.

01:19:07.950 --> 01:19:09.250
You don't mind, do you?

01:19:09.390 --> 01:19:11.850
It just makes things so much more interesting.

01:19:13.110 --> 01:19:14.750
You're doing very well, by the way.

01:19:14.930 --> 01:19:15.890
Very well indeed.

01:19:17.320 --> 01:19:19.220
The woman. Where are you hiding her?

01:19:31.080 --> 01:19:33.920
Borghav, what are you doing? We don't have time for this!

01:19:34.620 --> 01:19:37.280
Layla, are you in love with this Dunpeel?

01:19:37.280 --> 01:19:39.480
Are you crazy? What is wrong with you?

01:19:41.840 --> 01:19:42.540
Borghav!

01:19:44.340 --> 01:19:49.720
Pado!

01:20:02.940 --> 01:20:13.660
drop it now she took you in didn't she i'll still die i'm warning you dunfeel don't come any closer

01:20:16.890 --> 01:20:22.630
enough now you die

01:21:41.710 --> 01:21:42.520
She's coming!

01:22:31.950 --> 01:22:34.810
and you have betrayed his ancient blood.

01:22:34.810 --> 01:22:37.190
You side with humans against us.

01:22:40.370 --> 01:22:42.970
Our people are facing extinction

01:22:42.970 --> 01:22:45.730
and you're contributing to their demise.

01:22:45.730 --> 01:22:49.830
You stalk and kill your own ancestors, Dunpeel.

01:22:51.900 --> 01:22:56.830
You should be ashamed.

01:22:56.830 --> 01:22:59.000
Human self is your weaker self.

01:22:59.000 --> 01:23:00.000
Humans are nothing more than

01:23:00.060 --> 01:23:06.240
livestock we prey on them as they prey on beasts this is the rule of nature

01:23:06.240 --> 01:23:24.950
time is coming to an end your kind must face extinction you cannot survive you

01:23:24.950 --> 01:23:30.000
must die that is the rule of nature ah very strong

01:23:30.090 --> 01:23:38.560
words for a dun peel but you seem to forget our spirits are eternal no

01:23:38.560 --> 01:23:47.880
Carmilla nothing lasts forever I see I should have known better than to reason

01:23:47.880 --> 01:23:53.880
with your kind dun peel hunter I guess my only option is to use force

01:24:31.690 --> 01:24:33.270
NO, THIS CAN'T HAPPEN!

01:24:37.880 --> 01:25:00.000
The son of the vampire.

01:25:01.470 --> 01:25:04.680
Who are you? Are you done, Cleo?

01:25:04.680 --> 01:25:10.050
Is that?

01:25:40.620 --> 01:25:43.880
Charlotte, come back. I need you. Please come back.

01:25:49.170 --> 01:25:55.650
Mmm, you.

01:25:56.730 --> 01:25:58.620
It's me, Maya.

01:25:59.530 --> 01:26:00.000
I'm sorry.

01:26:00.280 --> 01:26:10.410
because we are together now at last together at last you made me happy

01:26:10.410 --> 01:26:16.800
Meyer you let me dream you let me dream of our beautiful trip to the stars our

01:26:16.800 --> 01:26:24.730
dream our beautiful wonderful dream it's not a dream we are going to those

01:26:24.730 --> 01:26:28.420
stars Charlotte oh my dear one

01:26:30.190 --> 01:26:35.340
you and i will get away from here we will fly together to the city of the night where we were

01:26:35.340 --> 01:26:45.200
meant to be free from all of this where you can rest my love finally and be free yes freedom at last

01:26:58.100 --> 01:27:00.000
my precious

01:27:00.570 --> 01:27:13.890
Brecious love, let's go away from here.

01:27:13.890 --> 01:27:22.690
Stop right there, Meyer.

01:27:22.690 --> 01:27:27.240
Taking her back, back to her family who loved her.

01:27:33.770 --> 01:27:36.190
She knew I loved her best of all.

01:27:37.270 --> 01:27:38.900
You can't understand it.

01:27:39.050 --> 01:27:40.870
You've never loved a human.

01:27:41.360 --> 01:27:42.840
I've never killed one either.

01:27:43.260 --> 01:27:49.480
You struggle to resist this nature of ours, but it can't last forever, dee?

01:27:50.310 --> 01:27:53.010
The urge for their blood is stronger.

01:27:53.760 --> 01:27:56.180
If that day comes, then another will hunt me.

01:27:56.630 --> 01:27:58.070
It's as simple as that.

01:28:35.180 --> 01:28:35.670
taste.

01:29:10.110 --> 01:29:13.320
Killing. Enough of misery and death.

01:29:37.040 --> 01:29:38.870
I've had enough.

01:30:07.800 --> 01:30:11.620
Did you miss my heart?

01:30:30.410 --> 01:30:33.840
I'll take it to her father as proof.

01:31:47.690 --> 01:31:51.010
- Mind giving me a ride just as far as the next town?

01:31:51.010 --> 01:31:56.910
I'd appreciate it.

01:31:56.910 --> 01:31:59.510
That reward money would rightfully be mine, you know.

01:32:00.030 --> 01:32:01.570
But hey, I'm generous.

01:32:01.570 --> 01:32:04.380
I'll let you keep it just this one time.

01:32:38.960 --> 01:32:40.210
Where is he taking her?

01:32:44.920 --> 01:32:45.880
Away from here.

01:33:05.560 --> 01:33:06.240
Take it.

01:34:07.680 --> 01:34:12.520
Dearly beloved, we are gathered here in this resting place to bid farewell to our sister.

01:34:13.750 --> 01:34:16.290
Into your gentle arms we commend her gracious spirit.

01:34:19.070 --> 01:34:22.310
Take her to yourself and give her safe haven.

01:34:22.310 --> 01:34:30.000
And though she struggled in life, now she knows your blessed peace for all who come.

01:34:30.090 --> 01:34:38.190
question will find answers, and all who love will find contentment, joy, and peace eternal.

01:34:39.020 --> 01:34:46.410
For now we see as through a glass darkly, but then we shall see clearly face to face.

01:35:01.080 --> 01:35:05.380
Excuse me, sir, but I was wondering if you knew my grandmother, Layla.

01:35:10.380 --> 01:35:13.100
It's you, isn't it?

01:35:13.610 --> 01:35:18.340
My grandmother told me about you, so I'd be honored if you'd come into our house.

01:35:18.420 --> 01:35:20.020
My dad would be so happy.

01:35:20.570 --> 01:35:21.330
Please?

01:35:22.530 --> 01:35:24.830
Appreciate your kindness.

01:35:25.520 --> 01:35:26.510
Oh, come on.

01:35:26.840 --> 01:35:28.200
We don't live very far.

01:35:32.400 --> 01:35:35.680
I just came here to keep a promise to an old friend of mine.

01:35:37.680 --> 01:35:40.420
She was afraid no one would mourn her death.

01:35:41.040 --> 01:35:42.460
I'm glad she was so wrong.

01:35:44.140 --> 01:35:46.040
Oh, I guess I see.

01:35:50.760 --> 01:35:53.040
Anyway, thank you for coming, sir.

01:36:12.250 --> 01:36:21.090
that was nice you're not so bad after all you just dress bad
